# Gemini API — used server-side in the Cloudflare Worker for voice transcript cleanup.
# Add to the Worker via: wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY is NOT a VITE_ variable — it stays on the server, never in the browser.
